#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Upgrades installed at the Soaratorium Lab. Installing one here also offers it, as the game installs only offered ones, and unlocks the supply drop set it gives. The three Item Box expansions stay once installed: a smaller box could lose what is stored past it."
msgstr "已在龙识船研究室安装的扩展。在此安装某项扩展时也会将其设为已提供（游戏只会安装已提供的扩展），并解锁该扩展带来的补给道具包。三项道具箱扩展一旦安装便会保留：箱子变小可能会丢失超出部分存放的物品。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Songs the Hunters' Pub Jukebox plays. The Mewstress unlocks the others when you talk to her."
msgstr "集会酒吧的店内歌曲。与酒吧看板娘交谈时，她会解锁其余曲目。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Read only: the Provision Division lists a set once its Lab upgrade or progress allows, whatever the save holds; the save only keeps which sets got their NEW mark."
msgstr "只读：只要研究室扩展或进度允许，道具补给队就会列出该道具包，与存档内容无关；存档只记录哪些道具包已显示过 NEW 标记。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Read only: the Mewstress lists a Horns Coin trade once its star level allows, whatever the save holds; the save only keeps which trades got their NEW mark."
msgstr "只读：只要星级允许，酒吧看板娘就会列出该坚角硬币兑换，与存档内容无关；存档只记录哪些兑换已显示过 NEW 标记。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Costumes for the village pets: Moofy's (the first six) and the Poogies'. Ten, twenty, twenty-eight and every Poogie costume earn the Poogie Ball awards after your next quest."
msgstr "村庄宠物的服装：菲妮的（前六套）和噗吱猪的。拥有十、二十、二十八套及全部噗吱猪服装后，会在下一次任务后获得噗吱猪球勋章。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Movies the Housekeeper's Gallery plays. Credits 2 and 3 come back at the next load once the ending is in the Gallery."
msgstr "管家画廊播放的影片。结尾动画进入画廊后，工作人员列表2和3会在下次读取时恢复。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "What the Trader puts up for sale. An entry for sale can be bought even without the download that sells it; what you already have is not shown."
msgstr "交易窗口上架出售的内容。上架的条目即使没有对应的下载内容也能购买；已拥有的不会显示。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Read only: the Trader lists an item once its star level allows, whatever the save holds; the save only keeps which items got their NEW mark."
msgstr "只读：只要星级允许，交易窗口就会列出该道具，与存档内容无关；存档只记录哪些道具已显示过 NEW 标记。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Read only: the Trader offers a delivery request once its villager's request is raised, whatever the save holds; the save only keeps which requests got their NEW mark."
msgstr "只读：村民的委托提出后，交易窗口就会提供对应的缴纳委托，与存档内容无关；存档只记录哪些委托已显示过 NEW 标记。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Extra Hunter's Notes entries of the Elder Dragons and deviants. Unlocking one gives the monster's Notes page its NEW mark, as the game does."
msgstr "古龙种和别名怪物的额外猎人笔记条目。解锁后，该怪物的笔记页面会像游戏中一样显示 NEW 标记。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Hunter's Notes tips read. A tip not read shows NEW once the game offers it."
msgstr "已读的猎人笔记提示。未读的提示在游戏提供后会显示 NEW。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Recipes combined at least once. A recipe never combined always succeeds the first time; 130 earn an award after your next quest."
msgstr "至少调和过一次的配方。从未调和过的配方第一次必定成功；达到 130 个后，会在下一次任务后获得勋章。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Scenes that play once. Clearing one plays it again the next time its place loads."
msgstr "只播放一次的场景。清除后，下次读取其所在地点时会再次播放。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "What the award checks read. Each award follows after your next quest once all its milestones are set."
msgstr "勋章检查所读取的进度。某个勋章的所有进度都设置后，会在下一次任务后获得该勋章。"

#: app/gui/src/views/unlocks_ui.rs
msgid "Read only: the shop sells an entry once its star level allows, whatever the save holds; the save only keeps which entries got their NEW mark."
msgstr "只读：只要星级允许，商店就会出售该条目，与存档内容无关；存档只记录哪些条目已显示过 NEW 标记。"

